What is the impact of this bug, that we decided to include it into AI 2.7?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16651824" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 16 Oct 2018 14:41:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master and AI 2.7. Despite that this is neither regression, nor blocker for release, I decided to include it into current release, because the fix is very limited and without it users will not be able to use ODBC from many applications (e.g. Excel). We&apos;d better to fix it now to minimize risk of any urgent bugfix releases.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
